ame":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T18:46:46-07:00","id":1246837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1246811#post1246811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think we might be working with different criteria here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then what's your criteria, pray tell?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T05:28:10-07:00","id":1246975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1246800#post1246800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That would involve Paradox Wolf thinking Chronicles was a product of value, which is counter to how they have previously discussed the game.<br /> <br /> So I wouldn't hold my breath.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yet they were willing to incorporate some of the design ethos of CoD into V5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T10:27:15-07:00","id":1247062,"title":"","content":"I'd really enjoy it. I heard there were going to be some big announcements at GenCon and was hoping this was it but there was nothing particularly interesting announced for Chronicles related stuff. The Bodhana Group collaboration was great to hear about, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T11:41:45-07:00","id":1247100,"title":"","content":"I've got a visit to the DMV, I might be able to explain my point in full there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T12:42:09-07:00","id":1247123,"title":"","content":"I don't know if this is the correct place to say this, but from what I can tell, Paradox Wolf treats CofD more as a thing to ignore rather than a thing that they've given a bone to (by accepting CofD 2nd Editions for example). <br /> <br /> It feels like they've taken the World of Darkness brand name and anything else is just something to be kept out of their hair. CofD is mentioned once on White-Wolf.com and The Onyx Path is mentioned twice. Both as footnotes and neither have links to theonyxpath.com.<br /> <br /> Compare that with Dev Blogs and news coming from here that mention WoD products and White Wolf rather frequently and talk frequently about things like the booths being so close at Gen Con. <br /> <br /> idk, to me, it seems like CofD is something they'd rather not talk about or admit exists as much as possible. <br /> <br /> <br /> ~~~~<br /> <br /> Still though, more on topic, couldn't OPP have something like the ST Vaults but under their name and made by them? Or would Paradox block that so as not to compete with the WoD ST Vaults?<br /> <br /> (Now that I say that, my guess is the latter considering Pugmire has an equivalent of an ST Vault but that game line has no connection with Paradox or White Wolf).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T13:46:04-07:00","id":1247150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1247123#post1247123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know if this is the correct place to say this, but from what I can tell, Paradox Wolf treats CofD more as a thing to ignore rather than a thing that they've given a bone to (by accepting CofD 2nd Editions for example).</div> </div> </div> </div>That's...not an unfair way to look at things.That they don't actively promote any non-WoD materials and don't acknowledge their existence.<br /> <br /> ...Which on its own is not really actively malicious. At best, they're confident enough in OPP's work that they don't feel the need to step in. At worst, CofD isn't worth their time and they'd rather focus on WoD.<br /> <br /> As disappointing it is that nuWW/Paradox isn't doing anything to actively support CofD, it's manageable. As nice it would be for them to be back in brick-and-mortar, it's not something that i feel is vital. Especially since my own FLGSs either focus entirely on board games or the usuals of D&amp;D, PF, Star Wars, and now Starfinder)<br /> <br /> Incidentally...no I don't think OPP can/will pull a Paizo and try to get CofD out from nuWW and go full Pathfinder on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T15:55:47-07:00","id":1247199,"title":"","content":"Xion has gotten out the gist of what I was going to point out, though I will point out that the management of Paradox Wolf <i>has</i> been heavily disparaging of ChroD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T15:58:56-07:00","id":1247201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1247199#post1247199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Xion has gotten out the gist of what I was going to point out, though I will point out that the management of Paradox Wolf <i>has</i> been heavily disparaging of ChroD</div> </div> </div> </div>...hasn't said management walked back a little bit from those initial comments, but just hasn't outright apologized for them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T16:17:21-07:00","id":1247208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1247201#post1247201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...hasn't said management walked back a little bit from those initial comments, but just hasn't outright apologized for them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, and I trust we all have experience with someone who didn't believe they said anything wrong but had to say something because the people around them expect it.<br /> <br /> THe failure of apology and the phrasing of their &quot;walk back&quot; speak volumes. Let's not pretend that Paradox Wolf is good at hiding their intentions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T16:33:48-07:00","id":1247216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1247208#post1247208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">THe failure of apology and the phrasing of their &quot;walk back&quot; speak volumes. Let's not pretend that Paradox Wolf is good at hiding their intentions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Either way, if nuWW had that much distaste for CofD, they wouldn't have bothered to keep it around.<br /> <br /> They would have shut it down and just had OPP go all-hands-on-deck with WoD5e. And even then, all we know for sure that OPP is doing is *just* Chicago by Night V5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T17:08:28-07:00","id":1247235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1247216#post1247216\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Either way, if nuWW had that much distaste for CofD, they wouldn't have bothered to keep it around.<br /> <br /> They would have shut it down and just had OPP go all-hands-on-deck with WoD5e. And even then, all we know for sure that OPP is doing is *just* Chicago by Night V5.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not how these politics work.<br /> <br /> 1) It's still a cash revenue with a solid base. PW may not <i>like</i> CofD and not want to draw any more attention then they have to, but no one says no free cash(and yes, this isn't free cash, but it's still cash flow).<br /> <br /> 2) They already have enough trouble dealing with the lashback of the old guard fanbase in response to the things they are trying out right now-pissing off even more of a fanbase and creating even more negative word-of-mouth by canning the CofD would really have hurt their business model, which they can't afford to do right now.<br /> <br /> 3) Also, CofD represents a loose alliance with the old guard of White Wolf's crew, in some ways, since OPP was born out of Richard catching the falling pieces from CCP and CofD has been a rather prominent feature of OPP's productions since it's inception.<br /> <br /> Like, as is, no, they don't like ChroD.* You are talking about people who clearly feel that it contributed to the fall of White Wolf and RPGs in general(whether or not they have a point is a subject all together). It definitely does not represent the glory days of gaming they so desperately want to try and revive.There's no point denying that.<br /> <br /> But it's current operations are beneficial in a wide variety, both in establishing legitimacy, maintaining a ready-and-curious word-of-mouth base for promotion, and keeping a decent cash flow coming in as it can, <i>so long as</i> it doesn't ultimately detract from what they're doing with World of Darkness. Give it time and possible success, and they might feel they can satisfactorily toss it off, but for now that's a dumb decision in practical terms.<br /> <br /> People can not like things and still keep them because they make sense for the current mode of operation. It happens a lot.<br /> <br /> *Which isn't to say they don't like individual lines within the entire franchise, because that would be silly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 08-18-2018, 03:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T17:19:18-07:00","id":1247238,"title":"","content":"^Which is fair.<br /> <br /> However, I feel there's no real reason to worry much about CofD right now.<br /> <br /> Even if they do decide to cancel CofD completely, it's not as if they're going to send spooks to roll in and forcibly confiscate everyone's books. And no, I don't think they would be as petty as removing CofD books from DRPG (if anything, it seems like nuWW is trying to distance themselves from DRPG and not make themselves reliant on it).<br /> <br /> Because otherwise, CofD is fine where it's at right now.<br /> <br /> Books are released at a steady pace, devs regularly interact with fans including clarifying on any rules and lore debates when able, and we have a healthy community of people.<br /> <br /> The stuff that could happen by nuWW/Paradox officially backing CofD...would just be adding more to what we already have right now. Even if there's no official ST Vault, it's not going to stop people from making and releasing homebrew stuff on the Internet. Or it not getting official multimedia projects...when we as players and STs can just make our own stories to our liking instead of being dependent on another group of people to do it for us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T22:37:29-07:00","id":1247916,"title":"","content":"I can only think they would cancel CofD if their numbers show that CofD cannibalizes part of the WoD market.<br /> However I think they catter to different public, CofD manages to get the people that want personal horror without the WoD metaplot while also exploring new splats such as prometheans, demons as robotic spies, beasts etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24237-pluvinarch","name":"Pluvinarch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-21T19:00:21-07:00","id":1248595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pluvinarch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1247916#post1247916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can only think they would cancel CofD if their numbers show that CofD cannibalizes part of the WoD market.<br /> However I think they catter to different public, CofD manages to get the people that want personal horror without the WoD metaplot while also exploring new splats such as prometheans, demons as robotic spies, beasts etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>This. As I see it, their only interest in ChroD lies in whether or not it's going to interfere with OWoD. As long as ChroD doesn't interfere, they have no reason to kill it. <br /> <br /> So: would ChroD material in Storyteller's Vault interfere with OWoD? If yes, you're not going to see it. If no, ParaWolf will probably allow it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-21T23:57:13-07:00","id":1248645,"title":"","content":"I must say that it looks kinda annoying- and silly- that a company decides for its buyers which game they should play, instead of deciding which game they should develop according to the one which, objectively, sells more and is more popular. I'm not an economist, but that sounds like a terrible way to do business. <br /> <br /> Anyway, I do hope to see a Storyteller's Vault for CofD, but with all the strange dynamics (to which I'm not even aware of), I won't eagerly wait for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T12:58:18-07:00","id":1248766,"title":"","content":"I'm not privy to the deal that WW and OPP has over the CofD license, but logically WW can only get part of the profits. Otherwise OPP would have to develop CofD with either no profits at all, or at a loss. Without knowing any sales figures I would still bet that WoD is more profitable for WW than CofD regardless of which one sells better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T15:10:35-07:00","id":1248776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1248766#post1248766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not privy to the deal that WW and OPP has over the CofD license, but logically WW can only get part of the profits. Otherwise OPP would have to develop CofD with either no profits at all, or at a loss. Without knowing any sales figures I would still bet that WoD is more profitable for WW than CofD regardless of which one sells better.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah: as far as I'm aware, no sales figures have ever been given from DRPG, or from OPP...and, well, they're aren't really obligated to give them out. <br /> <br /> And while the &quot;Hottest sales&quot; section on DRPG isn't the most precise of indicators...I have noticed that V20 is always consistently present, and it was always above VtR2e.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T18:14:29-07:00","id":1248799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1248645#post1248645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I must say that it looks kinda annoying- and silly- that a company decides for its buyers which game they should play, instead of deciding which game they should develop according to the one which, objectively, sells more and is more popular. I'm not an economist, but that sounds like a terrible way to do business.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's <i>way</i> more complicated than that, but it's worth noting that if Paradox Wolf were interested in Not Terrible Ways of Doing Business, they would have cleaned up their marketing campaign ages ago. They did not.<br /> <br /> Also, most businesses are never going to post their sales figures <i>directly </i>because that gives their opponents an idea of how the internals are working and how to respond in kind, which can hurt a whole friggin' lot. That said, there are ways to infer based off of exterior evidence based on things at the time, depending on how open a company is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-25T19:22:03-07:00","id":1248916,"title":"","content":"Well, Exaltd is getting added to the Vault, and I'm pretty sure OPP does all of the books for that line. So while I think it remains a long shot, I will upgrade my response to &quot;never say never.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-25T22:29:15-07:00","id":1248925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1246649-storytellers-vault-for-chronicles?p=1248916#post1248916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, Exaltd is getting added to the Vault, and I'm pretty sure OPP does all of the books for that line. So while I think it remains a long shot, I will upgrade my response to &quot;never say never.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>This is true. Up until this point, nuWW hasn't done anything directly with Exalted either...<br /> <br /> ...granted here we do have an official edition in Ex3. So it's a bit of a different situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-26T08:58:11-07:00","id":1248963,"title":"","content":"As Matt McElroy said on the Facebook announcement re Exalted hitting the SV: &quot;<span style=\"color:#1d2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Other settings will get unlocked over time. In part this is the first step to show that SV won't just be WoD exclusively.&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":1757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","user":"Acrozatarim","date":". 08-26-2018, 12:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-26T22:59:07-07:00","id":1249061,"title":"","content":"Fingers cross for CoD Vault's!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}